<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian 35-day T-bonds sell at 9.13 pct.</title>
<headline>Nigerian 35-day T-bonds sell at 9.13 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
